    <briefdescription>
<para>Geometry of a single knot span of a tensor-product B-spline of degree <computeroutput>order</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The element is one knot span <formula id="134">$ [u_p, u_{p+1}] $</formula> per direction of a B-spline of degree <formula id="135">$ p $</formula> = <computeroutput>order</computeroutput>. The <formula id="136">$ p+1 $</formula> basis functions that are nonzero on that span depend on the <formula id="82">$ 2p+2 $</formula> knots <formula id="137">$ u_0,\dots,u_{2p+1} $</formula> of each direction, which are passed to the constructor. The shape functions are tensor products of the univariate B-splines <formula id="138">$ B_{i,p} $</formula> (Cox<ndash/>de Boor recursion, see <ref refid="_marmot_b_spline_8h" kindref="compound">MarmotBSpline.h</ref>),    <formula id="139">\[  N_{a}(\boldsymbol{\xi}) = B_{i,p}(\xi_1)\,B_{j,p}(\xi_2)\,B_{k,p}(\xi_3), \qquad
  a = i + j\,(p+1) + k\,(p+1)^2 ,
\]</formula> i.e. with the index of the first direction running fastest. The parametric coordinates <formula id="61">$ \boldsymbol{\xi} $</formula> are the knot values themselves (the normalization of the knot vectors to <formula id="140">$ [-1,1] $</formula> is disabled, so <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_elements_1_1_b_spline_geometry_element_1aa27f6a8fb4c18ad6b94ad6a4cab28637" kindref="member">_knotVectorsNormalized</ref> is a copy of <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_elements_1_1_b_spline_geometry_element_1acb44744622a5fbd9bb661b73cc335ddf" kindref="member">_knotVectors</ref>).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Only 2D and 3D are usable: in 1D, the constructor throws for <computeroutput>order</computeroutput> &gt; 1 (no shape with <formula id="141">$ p+1 &gt; 2 $</formula> nodes in 1D), and <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_elements_1_1_b_spline_geometry_element_1ad1e0658864b8eaf141bacc21c2cfd678" kindref="member">dNdXi()</ref> would not compile if instantiated.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>nDim</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Spatial dimension (2 or 3). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>order</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Polynomial degree <formula id="135">$ p $</formula> of the B-spline. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
